<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">我这般惹人生厌</text><text for="L2">想必是个天大的麻烦吧？</text><text for="L3">算了吧 随它去</text><text for="L4">在满心抗拒里捱过当下</text><text for="L5">所谓的真心深爱</text><text for="L6">本就没有安稳妥帖的定论吧</text><text for="L7">算了吧 随它去 算了吧 随它去</text><text for="L8">算啦 也无妨 呵？</text><text for="L9">在喜欢与厌恶间反复拉扯</text><text for="L10">反反复复道出爱恨偏执</text><text for="L11">总叫人心生抗拒</text><text for="L12">回见吧 回头再聚 再见一面吧</text><text for="L13">说好再会 却又一次次拨弄撩拨</text><text for="L14">着实令人厌烦</text><text for="L15">心愿虽已得偿 却全因我犯下的过错</text><text for="L16">即便只剩残局 也是属于我的过往</text><text for="L17">任由言语肆虐 任思绪消亡 die</text><text for="L18">若能如愿偿清 哪怕背负一身过错</text><text for="L19">纵使所剩无几 也皆为我一力承担</text><text for="L20">任凭闲言碎语 肆意评说</text><text for="L21">教人深恶痛绝</text><text for="L22">终究成了多余累赘的祸患吧？</text><text for="L23">罢了 随它去</text><text for="L24">在万般不情愿中消磨此刻</text><text for="L25">挂在嘴边的极尽喜欢</text><text for="L26">从来就没有什么万全的把握吧</text><text for="L27">罢了 随它去 罢了 随它去</text><text for="L28">罢了 倒也无妨</text><text for="L29">心底终究是厌弃了吧？</text><text for="L30">不对 又是为了什么呢？</text><text for="L31">虽也曾拼命挣扎抵抗</text><text for="L32">到头来却还是会弄丢殆尽吧？</text><text for="L33">不愿遥望未知的以后 索性不再抱有期许</text><text for="L34">每个长夜都这般含糊敷衍着过去</text><text for="L35">你其实从未真正放在心上</text><text for="L36">言语的深意</text><text for="L37">也未曾刺痛你的眼眶</text><text for="L38">哪怕勤勉如浣熊</text><text for="L39">也会有偷懒懈怠的日子啊</text><text for="L40">睡吧 睡吧 对不对 你瞧这不是么？</text><text for="L41">我这般令人心烦</text><text for="L42">在你的宇宙里成了大麻烦对吧？</text><text for="L43">算了 莫去管</text><text for="L44">在千百次纠结回绝中蹉跎光阴</text><text for="L45">满口说着好喜欢你</text><text for="L46">感情里本就无所谓万全之策吧</text><text for="L47">算了 莫去管 算了 莫去管</text><text for="L48">罢啦 就这样吧</text><text for="L49">大概不过如此吧？你觉得呢</text><text for="L50">在这般芜杂交织的心绪里</text><text for="L51">不会去看吧？那场在录像电视里</text><text for="L52">放映过的公开巡演</text><text for="L53">你心里会怎么想呢？究竟会如何作想</text><text for="L54">枯竭沉落的涟漪水面</text><text for="L55">瞧啊 正悄然将一切轻拥入怀</text><text for="L56">哈？</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Daimeiwakusei."/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Daimeiwakusei. - Single"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1531658816"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPU902002268"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:01.340" end="3:54.350"><p begin="0:01.340" end="0:02.760" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:01.340" end="0:02.480">大嫌い</span><span begin="0:02.480" end="0:02.760">で</span></p><p begin="0:02.760" end="0:06.650" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:02.760" end="0:03.300">大</span><span begin="0:03.300" end="0:04.110">迷惑</span><span begin="0:04.110" end="0:04.350">な</span><span begin="0:04.530" end="0:05.420">存在</span><span begin="0:05.420" end="0:05.710">な</span><span begin="0:05.710" end="0:06.120">んで</span><span begin="0:06.120" end="0:06.650">しょう?</span></p><p begin="0:07.170" end="0:08.350" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:07.170" end="0:07.640">まあ</span> <span begin="0:07.640" end="0:08.020">いい</span><span begin="0:08.020" end="0:08.350">や</span></p><p begin="0:08.730" end="0:13.590" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:08.730" end="0:08.910">い</span><span begin="0:08.910" end="0:09.240">や</span><span begin="0:09.570" end="0:09.750">い</span><span begin="0:09.750" end="0:10.450">や</span><span begin="0:10.450" end="0:10.610">い</span><span begin="0:10.610" end="0:11.330">やって</span><span begin="0:11.330" end="0:11.830">過</span><span begin="0:11.830" end="0:12.180">ご</span><span begin="0:12.180" end="0:12.770">す</span><span begin="0:12.770"