:46.650" end="0:47.390">嫌い</span><span begin="0:47.390" end="0:47.890">好き</span><span begin="0:48.110" end="0:48.570">嫌</span><span begin="0:48.570" end="0:48.670">い</span><span begin="0:48.670" end="0:48.910">好</span><span begin="0:48.910" end="0:49.200">き</span><span begin="0:49.200" end="0:49.310">っ</span><span begin="0:49.310" end="0:50.020">て</span></p><p begin="0:51.270" end="0:52.930" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:51.270" end="0:51.560">な</span><span begin="0:51.560" end="0:51.680">ん</span><span begin="0:51.680" end="0:52.020">か</span><span begin="0:52.020" end="0:52.930">嫌だ</span></p><p begin="0:56.000" end="0:59.830" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:56.000" end="0:56.220">ま</span><span begin="0:56.220" end="0:56.540">た</span><span begin="0:56.750" end="0:57.180">会お</span><span begin="0:57.280" end="0:57.460">ま</span><span begin="0:57.460" end="0:57.830">た</span><span begin="0:58.020" end="0:58.770">会おま</span><span begin="0:58.770" end="0:59.110">た</span><span begin="0:59.320" end="0:59.480">会</span><span begin="0:59.480" end="0:59.830">お</span></p><p begin="0:59.830" end="1:03.710" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.830" end="1:00.060">ま</span><span begin="1:00.060" end="1:00.400">た</span><span begin="1:00.580" end="1:00.780">会</span><span begin="1:00.780" end="1:01.590">おまた</span><span begin="1:01.820" end="1:01.980">ま</span><span begin="1:01.980" end="1:02.520">た</span><span begin="1:02.520" end="1:02.930">煽</span><span begin="1:02.930" end="1:03.060">っ</span><span begin="1:03.060" end="1:03.710">て</span></p><p begin="1:04.980" end="1:06.810" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.980" end="1:05.290">な</span><span begin="1:05.290" end="1:05.400">ん</span><span begin="1:05.400" end="1:05.750">か</span><span begin="1:05.750" end="1:06.170">嫌</span><span begin="1:06.170" end="1:06.810">だ</span></p><p begin="1:09.490" end="1:12.580" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.490" end="1:10.130">叶っ<